    "excerpt": "A Fresh Start Deserves a Radiant Smile As the calendar turns and a new year begins, many people look for ways to refresh their appearance and boost their confidence. For some, that means a new fitness routine or wardrobe update. For others, it's as simple as one transformative change-a brighter, whiter smile. At Premier Dentistry...",
